  "title": "Cocaine‑Fueled Bear Rampage: The 1985 Georgia Murder Puzzle",
  "description": "In 1985, a pilot dropped a bag of cocaine in a Georgia forest and died hitting the doorframe. A black bear ate the drugs, became violent, and one hiker never came home.\n\nThe police found the bear's stomach full of cocaine. The case never got solved, but it became a legend.\n\nBased on the Wikipedia article \"Cocaine Bear\" (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cocaine_Bear), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.",
